### ONSVAL Project: Validation Tools for ONSEN YANG Models
* **Presented by:** China Telecom Research Institute / Chongfeng Xie
* **Slides:** [8) ONSVAL Project：Validation Tools for ONSEN YANG Models](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-onsen-onsval-projectvalidation-tools-for-onsen-yang-models-00)
* **Overview:**
  * Introduces ONSVAL, an open-source validation framework for evaluating ONSEN YANG model quality, interoperability, and end-to-end execution.
  * Evaluates five key quality dimensions: Syntax Conformance (pyang/yanglint), Instance Validity, Mappability & Contract Consistency (verifying L3SM to L3NM translation), Life-cycle State Integrity, and End-to-End System Fidelity (deploying configuration to physical/lab devices via Netconf).
  * Validation tooling and golden data sets are published on the ONSEN Wiki/GitHub.

