### Abstractions for Telco-Cloud Scenarios
* **Presented by:** Nabil Bitar
* **Slides:** [10) Abstractions for Telco-Cloud Scenarios](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-onsen-abstractions-for-telco-cloud-scenarios-00)
* **Overview:**
  * `draft-bitar-onsen-telco-cloud-abstractions` addresses infrastructure abstractions spanning edge and central data centers for dynamic workload placement, admission control, and lifecycle scaling.
  * Defines unified abstractions encompassing network connectivity, compute, storage, hardware accelerators (GPUs), and temporal/time-based resource availability to northbound Cloud Service Orchestrators.
  * Positioned as a future study topic within ONSEN; next steps include refining specific use cases (dynamic UPF, AI inference placement).

